          "beats": 1.0,
          "lyric": "is"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 3,
      "lyrics_text": "He upholds the widow and orphan but thwarts the path of the wicked. The Lord will reign forever, your God O Zion from age to age.",
